{"pageid":3540,"title":"Ice & Fire Cave","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Ice &amp; Fire Cave</span>","revid":16547,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d0/RobloxScreenShot20241110_145133422.png/revision/latest?cb=20241110141703\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"View from behind the waterfall\"><img alt=\"View from behind the waterfall\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d0/RobloxScreenShot20241110_145133422.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/284?cb=20241110141703\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"284\" height=\"178\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"RobloxScreenShot20241110 145133422.png\" data-image-key=\"RobloxScreenShot20241110_145133422.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a><figcaption>View from behind the waterfall</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b7/RobloxScreenShot20241110_145152380.png/revision/latest?cb=20241110141812\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"RobloxScreenShot20241110 145152380\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b7/RobloxScreenShot20241110_145152380.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/283?cb=20241110141812\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"283\" height=\"177\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"RobloxScreenShot20241110 145152380.png\" data-image-key=\"RobloxScreenShot20241110_145152380.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>The Ice &amp; Fire Cave is located behind the waterfall on top of where you can enter the <a href=\"/wiki/River_Caves\" title=\"River Caves\">River Caves</a>.\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p>To access it, you need to travel up to the two rivers area where you find <a href=\"/wiki/Dugg%27s_Digging\" title=\"Dugg&#39;s Digging\">Dugg's Digging</a>, follow down the streams, jump off the cliff of the warterfall onto a small edge.\n</p><p>Inside there are two small area connected whith each other, one is a fire area and the other one an ice. Both character are not interactable, and you can't pick up any of the items.\n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/90/RobloxScreenShot20241110_145214203.png/revision/latest?cb=20241110142028\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"RobloxScreenShot20241110 145214203\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/90/RobloxScreenShot20241110_145214203.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/342?cb=20241110142028\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"342\" height=\"214\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"RobloxScreenShot20241110 145214203.png\" data-image-key=\"RobloxScreenShot20241110_145214203.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/78/RobloxScreenShot20241110_145203109.png/revision/latest?cb=20241110141059\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"RobloxScreenShot20241110 145203109\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"342\" height=\"214\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"RobloxScreenShot20241110 145203109.png\" data-image-key=\"RobloxScreenShot20241110_145203109.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/78/RobloxScreenShot20241110_145203109.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/342?cb=20241110141059\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/cd/RobloxScreenShot20241110_145230607.png/revision/latest?cb=20241110142053\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"RobloxScreenShot20241110 145230607\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"342\" height=\"214\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"RobloxScreenShot20241110 145230607.png\" data-image-key=\"RobloxScreenShot20241110_145230607.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/cd/RobloxScreenShot20241110_145230607.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/342?cb=20241110142053\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><br />\nIn the far end of the cave, there is what seems to be a keyboard, what is it for...\n</p><p><br />\n<span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/0d/RobloxScreenShot20241110_145243433.png/revision/latest?cb=20241110142218\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"RobloxScreenShot20241110 145243433\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"368\" height=\"230\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"RobloxScreenShot20241110 145243433.png\" data-image-key=\"RobloxScreenShot20241110_145243433.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/0d/RobloxScreenShot20241110_145243433.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/368?cb=20241110142218\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<p>The Console at the back of the cave was the way of opening the bridge to <a href=\"/wiki/Ferwater_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ferwater Island\">Ferwater Island</a>  when it was first added to the game.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903000853\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.017 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.023 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 10/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate arg